{"2706790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quantic River", "steam_appid": 2706790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/3dd78df4ddbb80f4bf40ce6fc8a1f862.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and precise melee combat focused on parries, counter-attacks, and fluid chains. <br>Encounters are built around timing, reflexes, and control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9e35bf982f4458c5c17acc21eee3f914.poster.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9e35bf982f4458c5c17acc21eee3f914.webm?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9e35bf982f4458c5c17acc21eee3f914.mp4?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d0658f707f517cfdef120343f6745328.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many elements in the environment can be sliced or destroyed. <br>These interactions enhance both gameplay and immersion, creating tactical opportunities in real time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/afe1924adef845497a0fe4f78fc6d0a1.poster.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/afe1924adef845497a0fe4f78fc6d0a1.webm?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/afe1924adef845497a0fe4f78fc6d0a1.mp4?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4521aae37060a8a122e8027b5c1e0523.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgrades to enhance combat, hacking, or mobility. <br>Activate Quantum Anomalies to slow down time through an overheat system, ideal for shifting the pace of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d8c311c92d1f4bab63599bde1100e8dc.poster.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d8c311c92d1f4bab63599bde1100e8dc.webm?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d8c311c92d1f4bab63599bde1100e8dc.mp4?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/c88e17b95c499a76a9fe3345d218a1c3.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of security cameras to observe, interact with, or manipulate the environment remotely. <br>Disable defenses, open paths, and use hacking to access alternate routes across each level’s dual-layered structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d8160049018a9688eabc3e249cb748ca.poster.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d8160049018a9688eabc3e249cb748ca.webm?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d8160049018a9688eabc3e249cb748ca.mp4?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/3dd78df4ddbb80f4bf40ce6fc8a1f862.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and precise melee combat focused on parries, counter-attacks, and fluid chains. <br>Encounters are built around timing, reflexes, and control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9e35bf982f4458c5c17acc21eee3f914.poster.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9e35bf982f4458c5c17acc21eee3f914.webm?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9e35bf982f4458c5c17acc21eee3f914.mp4?t=1785589029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/d0658f707f517cfdef120343f6745328.avif?t=1785589029\" width=680 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many elements in